</span><span begin="00:27.390" end="00:27.600">here </span><span begin="00:27.600" end="00:28.050">alone </span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.050">（</span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.110">Too </span><span begin="00:28.110" end="00:28.230">fine</span><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.230">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.230" end="00:31.200"><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.410">On </span><span begin="00:28.410" end="00:28.710">other </span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:29.100">hand</span><span begin="00:29.100" end="00:29.250">, </span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.460">I </span><span begin="00:29.460" end="00:29.670">know </span><span begin="00:29.670" end="00:29.820">my </span><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.240">worth </span><span begin="00:30.240" end="00:30.240">（</span><span begin="00:30.240" end="00:30.270">Ah</span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.540">, </span><span begin="00:30.540" end="00:30.720">ah</span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:31.200">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.200" end="00:33.780"><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.410">And </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:31.590">now </span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:31.770">he </span><span begin="00:31.770" end="00:32.190">callin' </span><span begin="00:32.190" end="00:32.340">me</span><span begin="00:32.340" end="00:32.340">, </span><span begin="00:32.340" end="00:32.520">why </span><span begin="00:32.520" end="00:32.760">do </span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:32.880">I </span><span begin="00:32.880" end="00:33.150">feel </span><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.390">like </span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:33.630">this</span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.630">? </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.630">（</span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.780">Brrr</span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:33.780">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.780" end="00:35.490"><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.080">What's </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.740">happenin' </span><span begin="00:34.740" end="00:34.830">to </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:35.310">me</span><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:35.490">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.490" end="00:36.660"><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:35.700">Oh</span><span begin="00:35.700" end="00:35.880">, </span><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.030">oh</span><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.240">, </span><span begin="00:36.240" end="00:36.660">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.660" end="00:39.600"><span begin="00:36.660" end="00:36.870">Am </span><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:36.990">I </span><span begin="00:36.990" end="00:38.310">ready</span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.310">? </span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.310">（</span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.370">No </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.730">there </span><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:39.150">ain</span><span begin="00:39.150" end="00:39.180">’</span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.240">t </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.270">a </span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.600">doubt</span><span begin="00:39.600" end="00:39.600">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.600" end="00:42.840"><span begin="00:39.600" end="00:39.960">Am </span><span begin="00:39.960" end="00:40.080">I </span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:41.070">ready</span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.070">? </span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.070">（</span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.430">What </span><span begin="00:41.430" end="00:41.700">you </span><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:42.330">talkin' </span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.840">about</span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.840">?</span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.840">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.840" end="00:45.810"><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.050">Am </span><span begin="00:43.050" end="00:43.140">I </span><span begin="00:43.140" end="00:44.160"